# Showrunner repo root: only the framework + Tabloid template are tracked.
# Other projects in this directory (scratch work, unrelated repos) stay private.
#
# We use an allowlist: ignore everything at root by default, then opt in to
# the framework files we want to publish.

/*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE
!the-tabloid/

# Inside the-tabloid/ we rely on its own .gitignore for build artifacts
# (Python __pycache__, .venv, node_modules, .env, dump.rdb, etc).
